  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting communities and people in Mykolaiv and Ukraine to recover from crises and build resilience</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the project is to support people and communities affected by the conflict in Ukraine to be better enabled to recover from crisis and rebuild their lives. This will contribute to strengthened ability of conflict-affected communities in Mykolaiv to recover from the direct impact of the conflict and strengthened economic and social resilience of conflict-affected people in Mykolaiv. Moreover, the project will contribute to supporting Ukrainian Red Cross Society (URCS) at all levels to mobilize democratic civil society and youth to influence and participate in the reconstruction and recovery in Ukraine</narrative>
  </description>
